menu "decode_frame example"

    config EXAMPLE_FRAME_HEX
        string "Frame(s) as hex"
        default "68 15 15 68 08 00 72 45 33 08 24 C5 14 00 04 01 00 00 00 04 13 78 56 34 12 27 16"
        help
            One or more complete M-Bus telegrams (68 .. 16) in hex, spaces
            allowed. Separate several telegrams of one readout with ';'.
            No meter or UART is needed, the frames are only decoded.

endmenu
